ID         ! Identifier for the model configuration                         > DEFAULT
OAFENTRAINED! Entrained drop model at onset of annular flow selected from :class:`InputEnums.OAFENTRAINED`> EQUILIBRIUM
OAFDROPRATIO! Drop/Liquid mass ratio at onset of annular flow [-]            > 0.00001000000
DEPOSITION ! Drop deposition model selected from :class:`InputEnums.DEPOSITION`> OKAWA
ENTRAINMENT! Film entrainment model selected from :class:`InputEnums.ENTRAINMENT`> OKAWACT
MOMENTFILM ! Film momentum conservation model selected from :class:`InputEnums.MOMENTFILM`> ALGEBRAIC
THINFILMFRIC! Thin film wall friction model selected from :class:`InputEnums.THINFILMFRIC`> TRACE
THINFILMTHICK! Minimum thin film thickness [m]                                > 0.00000000500
VAPORFRIC  ! Vapor friction model selected from :class:`InputEnums.VAPORFRIC`> WALLISTHICK
RETRANSITION! Reynolds number at which wall friction factor transitions from laminar to turbulent> 1000.00000000000
VAPORFRICCST! Vapor friction constant [-]                                    > 0.00500000000
NNODES     !                                                                > 100.00000000000
FLUID      ! CoolProp fluid identifier                                      > R245FA
END

